{"ref":"BDB, אֲבִיעֶ֫זֶר","hw":"אֲבִיעֶ֫זֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִיעֶ֫זֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>my father is help</em><strong>)</strong>—= <span dir=\"rtl\">אִיעֶזֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:30\" href=\"/Numbers.26.30\">Nu 26:30</a>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a Manassite, called ‘son’ of Gilead <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:30\" href=\"/Numbers.26.30\">Nu 26:30</a> (cf. Di) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:2\" href=\"/Joshua.17.2\">Jos 17:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:34\" href=\"/Judges.6.34\">Ju 6:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:2\" href=\"/Judges.8.2\">8:2</a>; and son of Gil.’s sister <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.18\">1 Ch 7:18</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Benjamite, a warrior of David <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:27\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.27\">2 S 23:27</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.28\">1 Ch 11:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.12\">27:12</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲבִי הָעֶזְרִי","prev":"BDB, אֲבִינֵר"}